7c. C\u00e1i x\u00edch nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ecbnh kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ecbu v\u00e0o. Ch\u00fa Ba ch\u1ec9 cho c\u1eadu m\u1eb9o, ch\u1eadm r\u00e3i, \u0111\u00fang m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n. Ch\u00fa l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi t\u1eebng tr\u1ea3i, v\u00e0 ch\u1eb3ng bao gi\u1edd gi\u1ea3i th\u00edch \u0111i\u1ec1u g\u00ec \u0111\u1ebfn l\u1ea7n th\u1ee9 hai.`},{`en`:`[[At]] [[lunch]], Minh [[asked|ask]], \`[[How]] [[many]] [[people]] [[applied|apply]] [[for]] [[this]] [[job]]?\` \`[[One]],\` [[said|say]] Mr Ba. \`[[So]] [[I]] [[was|be]] [[the]] [[best]] [[candidate]]!\` \`[[You]] [[were|be]] [[the]] [[only]] [[candidate]]. [[That]] [[makes|make]] [[you]] [[the]] [[best]] [[and]] [[the]] [[worst]].\``,`vn`:`Gi\u1edd \u0103n tr\u01b0a, Minh h\u1ecfi: \`C\u00f3 bao nhi\u00eau ng\u01b0\u1eddi xin vi\u1ec7c n\u00e0y h\u1ea3 ch\u00fa?\` \`M\u1ed9t,\` ch\u00fa Ba \u0111\u00e1p. \`V\u1eady ch\u00e1u l\u00e0 \u1ee9ng vi\u00ean gi\u1ecfi nh\u1ea5t r\u1ed3i!\` \`C\u1eadu l\u00e0 \u1ee9ng vi\u00ean duy nh\u1ea5t. Ngh\u0129a l\u00e0 v\u1eeba gi\u1ecfi nh\u1ea5t, v\u1eeba k\u00e9m nh\u1ea5t.\``},{`en`:`[[At]] [[four]], Tom [[came|come]] [[back]]. [[Everything]] [[was|be]] [[on]] [[the]] [[new]] [[frame]], [[even]] [[the]] [[little]] [[student]] [[union]] [[flag]] [[from]] [[his]] [[university]]. [[He]] [[rode|ride]] [[up]] [[and]] [[down]] [[the]] [[street]], [[ringing|ring]] [[his]] [[bell]]. \`[[Brilliant]]! [[It's|it]] [[the]] [[same]] [[bike]], [[but]] [[a]] [[different]] [[bike]]!\``,`vn`:`B\u1ed1n gi\u1edd, Tom quay l\u1ea1i. M\u1ecdi th\u1ee9 \u0111\u00e3 n\u1eb1m tr\u00ean chi\u1ebfc khung m\u1edbi, k\u1ec3 c\u1ea3 l\u00e1 c\u1edd nh\u1ecf c\u1ee7a h\u1ed9i sinh vi\u00ean tr\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u1ea1i h\u1ecdc anh. Anh \u0111\u1ea1p xe l\u00ean xu\u1ed1ng con ph\u1ed1, b\u1ea5m chu\u00f4ng k\u00ednh coong. \`Tuy\u1ec7t! V\u1eabn l\u00e0 chi\u1ebfc xe \u1ea5y, m\u00e0 l\u1ea1i l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc xe kh\u00e1c!\``},{`en`:`[[At]] [[five]], Mr Ba [[smoked|smoke]] [[his]] [[one]] [[ci